==Battleground==
*8 [[Croco]]s spawn, delay 3.33~10 seconds<sup>100f~300f</sup>.
*8 [[Croco]]s spawn after 16.67 seconds<sup>500f</sup>, delay 6.67~13.33 seconds<sup>200f~400f</sup>.
*8 [[Croco]]s spawn after 33.33 seconds<sup>1,000f</sup>, delay 10~16.67 seconds<sup>300f~500f</sup>.
*1 [[Kang Roo]] spawns after 40 seconds<sup>1,200f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[The Face]] spawns as the boss.
**Infinite [[Squire Rel]]s spawn, delay 8.33~16.67 seconds<sup>250f~500f</sup>.

==Strategy==
This stage is quite simple. Use meatshields and attackers to defeat Kang Roo and use the cash to defeat The Face. Bring [[:Category:Anti-Floating Cats|anti-Floating Cats]] such as [[Swimmer Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Swimmer Cat]] if you are having trouble.

